-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §60 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר של מורים אקדמאיים: a
-- non-academic who completed a degree is placed on the academic table — the
-- coefficient to it the full Y times each seniority year's step times the
-- grade steps (§57) times the degree's addition (5% for a senior certified,
-- 15% for a certified, 25% for an uncertified teacher or instructor); A = X
-- on the move × that coefficient; the grade nearest at or above A.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `56`

§ `60 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר של מורים אקדמאיים`

-- ¶1: "מורה כאמור בסעיף 51 (א) או (ג)". F-ofek-hadash-base-60-a: §51(ג)
-- defines seniority for pay and names no teachers; the teachers §60
-- places are §51(א)'s and (ב)'s, whom §51(ב)(2) sends to §60. The reading
-- adopted (convention reading.misprint): §51(א) or (ב).
@ref akn:art_60
DECLARE `paragraph of section 51` IS ONE OF `51(א) teachers who signed`, `51(ב) teachers of 28 years or more`, `51(ג) the definition of seniority`

`the paragraphs of §51 that name teachers` MEANS
    LIST `51(א) teachers who signed`, `51(ב) teachers of 28 years or more`
`the paragraphs §60 names` MEANS
    LIST `51(א) teachers who signed`, `51(ג) the definition of seniority`
`60 names a paragraph of §51 that holds no teachers` MEANS
    NOT all (GIVEN p YIELD elem p `the paragraphs of §51 that name teachers`) `the paragraphs §60 names`
#ASSERT `60 names a paragraph of §51 that holds no teachers`

-- (א): the coefficient: (1 + Y) × each year's step × the grade steps ×
-- (1 + the degree's addition).
@ref akn:art_60__para_a akn:art_60__para_a/p2 akn:art_60__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_60__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_60__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `non-academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the degree's addition` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `a senior certified teacher` THEN 5%
    WHEN `a certified teacher` THEN 15%
    WHEN `an uncertified teacher or instructor` THEN 25%

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `step of each seniority year` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `step of each grade` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      r IS A `non-academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coefficient to the B.A. table` y `step of each seniority year` `step of each grade` r IS
    (1 PLUS y)
        TIMES product (map (GIVEN s YIELD 1 PLUS s) `step of each seniority year`)
        TIMES product (map (GIVEN s YIELD 1 PLUS s) `step of each grade`)
        TIMES (1 PLUS `the degree's addition` r)

-- (ב): A = X on the day of the move × the coefficient. No rounding is
-- stated (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_60__para_b akn:art_60__para_b/p2
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, coefficient IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A to the B.A. table` x coefficient IS
    x TIMES coefficient

-- (ג): placed by seniority at the whole or intermediate grade nearest at or
-- above it (§46(ב)'s rule).
@ref akn:art_60__para_c
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, `row of the B.A. table` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `the placement on the B.A. table` a `row of the B.A. table` IS
    `the placement in the row` a `row of the B.A. table`

#ASSERT `the degree's addition` `an uncertified teacher or instructor` EQUALS 25%
